5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. I believe we should look into our staffing and volunteers to ensure we don't overwork our dear team.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I agree we need a logical approach. I'm interested in the logistics of our previous openings to see where the actual failures occurred.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's not be too gloomy! I want to know what actually brings the people back. Let's look at the visitor data and comments.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about the physical limits of the gallery. I'll check the structural survey and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to find the mystery of the disappearing money! I'll look into the transport costs and the mount-making charges!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
