30,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I am afraid our conservation lab is quite overwhelmed, and our volunteers are mostly from the history circle. We must be mindful of this.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shion,,It seems my suspicions were correct. Shipping delays and high transport costs are our primary bottlenecks. We should avoid heavy reliance on distant loans.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"Interestingly, the visitors love it when there is a human element or some movement in the room. Static displays just don't draw them back.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and our evening events mean we cannot have fragile, open installations that might be bumped by caterers.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Wow! Transport costs are huge! And the joiner's rates are going up! We should pick something that doesn't need fancy new mounts or expensive shipping.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, that is a very good point. Perhaps a local exhibition would be kinder to our budget and our staff.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, if the bay is limited and the evening hire is a risk, we must avoid heavy sculptures or sprawling, delicate kinetic art.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, if we have a lot of history volunteers, maybe they could be the ""human element"" the visitors are asking for?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, that sounds plausible. As long as the exhibition doesn't exceed the floor's weight capacity or block the gallery's utility.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Sakura,,Let's find something that's local and easy to set up! No more money-swallowing surprises!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. A local focus would allow our history circle volunteers to shine without adding to the lab's backlog.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shion,,"Logically, we should avoid anything with complex international shipping or high-maintenance powered displays.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,I'm leaning towards something interactive or live. The data shows that's what people actually enjoy.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I will support any choice that is structurally safe and doesn't interfere with the gallery's evening functions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Sakura,,Yay! I'm so excited to see the candidates!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
