55,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Candidate A seems lovely. Local craftspeople and demonstrations would suit our volunteers and not burden the lab.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Candidate D involves too many loans, which we know is a risk. Candidate C's rigging might be a structural and maintenance nightmare.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,May,,"Candidate A and B both have that ""human presence"" I found in the records. A working bench in B or demonstrations in A would be hits.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Candidate B's ""excavation finds"" might be too heavy for the suspended bay. Candidate A is lightweight and easy to manage.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Sakura,,Candidate A is local! That means low transport costs and no scary invoices! I love it!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, I think the demonstrations in A would be more sustainable for our current staff than a working conservation bench in B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, I agree. A is the most logical choice to avoid the shipping delays and structural risks I've identified.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, you're right. A combines the human element with low risk. It's a winner for the visitors.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Misaki,,Candidate A is the safest for the building and the most compatible with our evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Sakura,,Everyone likes A! It's like a puzzle where all the pieces finally fit!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am very happy we have found a solution that cares for both the visitors and our hardworking staff.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shion,,It is the only choice that minimizes all the identified operational risks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,May,,"It's charming, interactive, and efficient. I'm fully on board.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I concur. It is the most responsible choice for the gallery space.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for A! Let's do it!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
